sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant H as handle()
    participant CI as classify_intent()
    participant R as retrieve()
    participant LLM as LLM generate()
    participant HI as handle_intent()

    C->>H: message
    H->>CI: message
    CI->>R: message
    R-->>CI: 5 most similar train rows
    CI->>LLM: prompt = 77 intent names + constraint + 5 examples + message (greedy, 32 tokens)
    LLM-->>CI: "card_arrival"
    Note over CI: parse_intent, then validate against the 77-name schema
    CI-->>H: {"intent": "card_arrival"} or {"error": ...}

    alt error
        H-->>C: "Sorry, I could not understand your request. Could you say it in a different way?"
    else valid intent
        H->>HI: intent
        HI-->>H: {intent, status: done | information | unsupported, result, [reference]}
        H->>LLM: chat history: system prompt, message, both tool calls, both tool results (temperature 0.7, 80 tokens)
        LLM-->>H: reply text
        H-->>C: reply
    end
